# Retrieval-eval results land here as <YYYY-MM-DD>.json, produced ONLY by a real
# `make eval-retrieval` run (Issue #344). Never hand-write or fabricate these
# numbers — a fabricated baseline silently corrupts the regression signal.
# The first baseline is generated by a maintainer running the live harness in an
# environment with Postgres + Qdrant + an embedding provider + Sudachi.
